<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh Bengal Biscuit 95/96 profit up 79 pct.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh Bengal Biscuit 95/96 profit up 79 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The year ended on June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>	  (In million taka unless stated)</p>
<p>			    1995/96		1994/95</p>
<p>    Net profit	  30.1	vs	 16.8</p>
<p>    Gross profit	79.3	vs	 55.4</p>
<p>    Sales		 233.8     vs	 171.2</p>
<p>    Dividend	    Nil vs 25 taka on 100-taka share.</p>
<p>Note: Bengal Biscuits Ltd held its annual general meeting on Friday. It said the higher profit in the year was a result of better quality products and efficient management despite political unrest in the country. It did not pay any dividend, but offered one bonus share against five shares held by the investors.</p>
</text>
